  "prefLabel": "Env-Or 608.04 AUR Notification",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Or 608.04 AUR Notification.\n\n(a) Within 30 days of the date on which the department approves the AUR application pursuant to Env-Or 608.02(c), the applicant shall provide notice to current holders of any interest in the site of the existence and location of the contamination subject to the AUR.\n\n(b) Notice sent pursuant to (a), above, shall be sent by certified mail, return receipt requested.\n\n(c) Within 60 days of the date on which the department approves the AUR application pursuant to Env-Or 608.02(c), the applicant shall submit documentation of the notification required in (a), above, to the department.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Or 600) #8812, eff 2-1-07; ss by #10831, eff 6-1-15; ss by #14419, eff 11-4-25, EXPIRES: 11-4-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-or600.html"
